Subject: [PATCH] Inline Maxwell 3D register state writes

Adapt Lichii 73a1b58e7d7a3b02f116c897a2c8487923256b1a (#1095) to T120.
Keep its existing command dispatch, query-light exception and profiling.

diff --git a/src/video_core/engines/maxwell_3d.cpp b/src/video_core/engines/maxwell_3d.cpp
